OL,3,ABritain won't tolerate threats on our
OL,4,Asoil, Miliband says as he summons Iran
OL,5,Aambassador
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe foreign secretary has summoned the
OL,8,FIranian ambassador to make clear that
OL,9,F"Britain will not tolerate threats on
OL,10,Four soil" following last month's
OL,11,Fincident at RAF Fairford.
OL,13,FEd Miliband said attempts by Iran to
OL,14,Fundermine the UK's security "through
OL,15,Fits criminal networks, proxy groups and
OL,16,Fstate-backed malign activity is
OL,17,Funacceptable".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
