OL,3,ABritain won't tolerate threats on our
OL,4,Asoil, Miliband says as he summons Iran
OL,5,Aambassador
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham told MPs
OL,8,Fthe incident in Gloucestershire was
OL,9,F"almost certainly directed by Iran's
OL,10,FIslamic Revolutionary Guard", while the
OL,11,Fhome secretary said the likely
OL,12,Fcoordinator was a "known individual
OL,13,Fbased in Iran".
OL,15,FIran's ambassador to the UK, Seyed Ali
OL,16,FMousavi, said Tehran was not involved
OL,17,Fand was willing to cooperate with
OL,18,FBritish authorities.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
